OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of bright spells and
OL,6,Foccasional blustery showers, some
OL,7,Fheavy. A windy day too with strong to
OL,8,Fgale force southwesterly winds, these
OL,9,Feasing a little later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOccasional showers will
OL,12,Fcontinue across northern areas
OL,13,Fespecially, with a few also reaching
OL,14,Fthe Soway coast, though the best of
OL,15,Fthe clear spells will be here. Winds
OL,16,Feasing further.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,19,Fand a few showers these mostly across
OL,20,Fthe Lothians. Less windy and a little
OL,21,Fmilder too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
